# Regenerable cache and generated output. content/ is the source of truth;
# everything below is rebuilt by scripts/{fetch,match,build-data}.ts and is
# disposable by design.
#
# Note content/tmdb-seed/ is deliberately NOT here: those files cover series
# with no real TMDB id, so nothing can re-fetch them. They are source data, and
# a fresh clone needs them to build. See content/tmdb-seed/README.md.
